    {
      "zh": "它每天看别的龙在水里玩。",
      "en": "Every day it watched the other dragons playing in the water."
    },
    {
      "zh": "它去河里，水很深，很冷。",
      "en": "It went into the river; the water was very deep and cold."
    },
    {
      "zh": "它不想下水，只想看别人游。",
      "en": "It did not want to go in; it only wanted to watch the others swim."
    },
